- [`{{ archive_name }}`]({{ public("v" ~ version ~ "/" ~ record.archive.href) }}): the PMTiles web map archive from z{{ record.archive.minzoom }} to z{{ record.archive.maxzoom }}, with the layers `{{ spec.pmtiles_layers | join("`, `") }}`. {% if overview %}Below z{{ complete_zoom }} the layer is an overview. Features that span {{ shape_min_px }} pixels at a zoom show as simplified outlines. Smaller features show as points at RGI's `cenlon` and `cenlat`, and each grid cell of about a pixel keeps the point of the largest feature. Overview features contain only `{{ overview | join("`, `") }}`. From z{{ complete_zoom }} the tiles{% else %}The tiles{% endif %} contain every column except the list and struct columns, which vector tiles cannot store: `{{ untiled | join("`, `") }}`. Fetch those from the GeoParquet file by `{{ spec.key | default("rgi_id") }}`.{% if has_timestamps %} Timestamps are strings in the tiles.{% endif %}

